{"pageid":4413,"title":"Acacia Burl","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Acacia Burl</span>","revid":20344,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 161px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/92/Acacia_burl.png/revision/latest?cb=20251105011704\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"An acacia burl on a tree\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/92/Acacia_burl.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/161?cb=20251105011704\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"161\" height=\"267\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Acacia burl.png\" data-image-key=\"Acacia_burl.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Acacia_burl.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">An acacia burl on a tree</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Burls\" title=\"Burls\">Burls</a> are a sub-resource of trees. <b>Acacia Burls</b> partially - rarely spawn on <a href=\"/wiki/Acacia\" title=\"Acacia\">Acacia Trees</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater\" title=\"Ferwater\">Ferwater</a> island, <b><a href=\"/wiki/Acacia\" title=\"Acacia\">acacia</a> burls</b> usually spawn on the base of larger acacia trees<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Finding an acacia burl isn't considered rare, as they are quite common in <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater\" title=\"Ferwater\">Ferwater</a> island.\n</p><p><br />\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Acacia Burl</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"prices\">Sell Prices</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"$/burl\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">$/Burl</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$664</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"$/sanded\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">$/Sanded</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$3322</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Acacia tree burls never spawn on skinny trees, only ever spawning on the thicker, larger trees.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903162954\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 40/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 49/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 183/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.603      1 Template:Burl\n100.00%    7.603      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4413-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903162954 and revision id 20344. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Acacia","exists":true},{"title":"Burls","exists":true},{"title":"Ferwater","exists":